  "releaseNotes": "New methods:\n- CreateUser: (Creates a new user)\n- GetDocumentAccessKey: (Queries the access key of the currenty loaded document)\n- OpenLeftUserDocumentByAccessKey: (Opens a document in the control browser)\n- SaveCurrentDocument: (Saves the current document)\n\nNew events:\n- CreateUserSuccess: (Sent if a new user is created successfully)\n- PortalError: (Sent if an error occured in the portal)\n- SaveCurrentDocumentSuccess: (Sent if the current document is saved)",
